{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T16:57:22+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-30T16:57:22+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Daimler Truck Holding AG","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Farm & Heavy Construction Machinery","country":"Germany","city":"Leinfelden-Echterdingen","website":"https://www.daimlertruck.com","employees":98869,"summary":"Daimler Truck Holding AG manufactures and sells light, medium- and heavy-duty trucks and buses in Europe, North America, Asia, Latin America, and internationally. The company operates through five segments: Trucks North America, Mercedes-Benz Trucks, Trucks Asia, Daimler Buses, and Financial Services. It offers light, medium, and heavy-duty trucks; city and intercity buses, coaches, and bus chassis; industrial engines; and special vehicles used in various sector, as well as new and used commercial vehicles. The company also provides various financial services, such as rental, leasing, and financing for vehicles; and charging infrastructure, insurance brokerage, payment, and integrated services for zero emission vehicles. In addition, it offers connectivity solutions under the Detroit Connect, Truckonnect, TruckLive, OMNIplus ON, Mercedes-Benz Uptime, and Fleetboard brand names; and aftersales services, as well as sells spare parts. It provides trucks and buses under the Mercedes-Benz, Freightliner, Western Star, FUSO, BharatBenz, RIZON, Setra, and Thomas Built Buses brands. The company was founded in 1896 and is headquartered in Leinfelden-Echterdingen, Germany.","exchange":"XETRA","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Daimler Truck Holding AG fabrique et vend des camions et des autobus légers, moyens et lourds en Europe, en Amérique du Nord, en Asie, en Amérique latine et à l'étranger. La société opère à travers cinq segments : Trucks North America, Mercedes-Benz Trucks, Trucks Asia, Daimler Buses et Financial Services. Il propose des camions légers, moyens et lourds, des autobus urbains et interurbains, des autocars et des châssis d'autobus, des moteurs industriels et des véhicules spéciaux utilisés dans divers secteurs, ainsi que des véhicules utilitaires neufs et d'occasion."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":30788630528,"shares_outstanding":760213105,"trailing_pe":28.124998,"forward_pe":8.436339,"price_to_book":1.3640957,"ev_to_ebitda":13.338,"ev_to_revenue":1.122,"dividend_yield":0.0468,"payout_ratio":1.3194001,"beta_yahoo":0.951},"targets":{"current_price":40.5,"mean":50.8,"median":52.3,"high":63.0,"low":33.0,"n_analysts":18,"reco_mean":2.16667,"reco_key":"buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-11-06"],"eps_avg":1.05817,"eps_low":1.05817,"eps_high":1.05817,"revenue_avg":12521089490,"ex_dividend":"2026-05-07","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.3762,"institutions_pct":0.32187,"institutions_float_pct":0.51598,"institutions_n":432,"institutions":[{"name":"Pacer Advisors, Inc.","pct":0.0008,"shares":665624,"value":26957772,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.3247},{"name":"Paradigm Asset Management Company, LLC","pct":0.0,"shares":26900,"value":1089450,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0},{"name":"Generali Investments Cee, Investicni Spolecnost, A.s.","pct":0.0,"shares":375,"value":15187,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.0}],"funds":[{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0089,"shares":7304885,"value":295847842,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.015700001},{"name":"HARRIS ASSOCIATES INVESTMENT TRUST-Oakmark International Fund","pct":0.0058999998,"shares":4880043,"value":197641741,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.050300002},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0058999998,"shares":4856279,"value":196679299,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0223},{"name":"Principal Funds, Inc-International Equity Fund","pct":0.0052,"shares":4238261,"value":171649570,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0212},{"name":"iShares